    "Connects like ssh -o ProxyCommand='cloudflared access ssh --hostname %h', without cloudflared. Leave the service token empty when the application has no Access policy. The port only names the server's host key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接方式等同于 ssh -o ProxyCommand='cloudflared access ssh --hostname %h'，但无需 cloudflared。如果应用没有 Access 策略，请将服务令牌留空。端口仅用于标识服务器的主机密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "連線方式等同於 ssh -o ProxyCommand='cloudflared access ssh --hostname %h'，但無需 cloudflared。如果應用沒有 Access 策略，請將服務令牌留空。埠僅用於標識伺服器的主機金鑰。"
