    "Rayon sends anonymous crash reports and feature counts to help fix bugs. It never sends your servers, usernames or terminal content." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rayon 会发送匿名崩溃报告和功能使用计数以帮助修复错误。它从不发送你的服务器、用户名或终端内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rayon 會發送匿名崩潰報告和功能使用計數以幫助修復錯誤。它從不傳送你的伺服器、使用者名稱或終端內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rayon telemetry reports" : {
